{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">About This Demo</h2>This demo features the full gameplay experience of <strong>Cursed Blood </strong>\u2014 including singleplayer, online multiplayer, and local co-op \u2014 but is limited to <strong>1 level</strong> and <strong>3 katanas.</strong><br>All core systems, combat mechanics, and online functionality are fully available to try.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Please Note:</h2>Progress made in this demo will not carry over to the full game.<br><br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3499930/extras/Logo.png?t=1744703111\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Cursed Blood is a brutal 1-4 player co-op samurai action roguelike where players take on the role of ruthless samurai apes on a revenge spree against the mafia who exploited their sacred Shrine of Vermillion.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The Shrine now demands retribution\u2014delivered by katana through swift and unrelenting violence.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3499930/extras/Banner1_CoOp.png?t=1744703111\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3499930/extras/gif1.gif?t=1744703111\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Mix both <strong>online</strong> and <strong>local co-op</strong> with friends on the couch &amp; friends joining in from across the world, all in the same run.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Or, <strong>go at it alone</strong> and see if you can get vengeance by yourself!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3499930/extras/Banner2_FastStealth.png?t=1744703111\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3499930/extras/gif2.gif?t=1744703111\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Combine swift dashes, bullet deflection, brutal takedowns, and charged attacks to dispatch enemies with samurai-like precision. Unleash devastating finishers and heal by absorbing the blood of your foes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Carve your path through procedurally crafted levels filled with challenges, secrets, and blood filled action.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3499930/extras/Banner3_PowerfulGunplay.png?t=1744703111\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3499930/extras/gif3.gif?t=1744703111\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Defeat enemies, seize their weapons, and turn their firepower against them\u2014until ammo runs dry. Then throw the gun back in their face and attack with a powered up katana attack to <strong>split them in half</strong>!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Blood will spray, limbs will fly and enemies will crawl away screaming for mercy, but no mercy will be given...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3499930/extras/Banner4_UnlockNewKatana.png?t=1744703111\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3499930/extras/gif4.gif?t=1744703111\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Explore a visually striking world where industrial-era machinery blends with blood-powered technology, to find ancient chests containing shards for powerful katanas and new gear.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Each katana has its <strong>unique perk</strong> empowering different playstyles.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3499930/extras/Banner5_UnlockNewKatana.png?t=1744703111\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3499930/extras/gif5.gif?t=1744703111\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Face a variety of increasingly challenging bosses that evolve in several stages while fighting them. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Defeat these formidable foes, grab their head and sacrifice it to the Shrine of Vermillion to bring back balance to the world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3499930/extras/Banner6_Replayability.png?t=1744703111\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3499930/extras/gif6.gif?t=1744703111\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Unlock World Mutations that drastically change the rules of gameplay and reward you with new Katanas by completing them.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Cursed Blood has a challenge for everyone and something to bite your teeth into for hours and hours.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3499930?t=1744703111","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3499930?t=1744703111","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3499930/babd56cd004d48002c7e93548c00da5013b1bf58/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1744703111","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3499930/babd56cd004d48002c7e93548c00da5013b1bf58/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1744703111","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Online Co-op","id":38},{"description":"Shared/Split Screen Co-op","id":39},{"description":"Shared/Split Screen","id":24},{"description":"Game demo","id":10},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[2,5],"notes":"Gore, swearing."},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">About This Demo</h2>This demo features the full gameplay experience of <strong>Cursed Blood </strong>\u2014 including singleplayer, online multiplayer, and local co-op \u2014 but is limited to <strong>1 level</strong> and <strong>3 katanas.</strong><br>All core systems, combat mechanics, and online functionality are fully available to try.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Please Note:</h2>Progress made in this demo will not carry over to the full game.<br><br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3499930/extras/Logo.png?t=1744703111\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Cursed Blood is a brutal 1-4 player co-op samurai action roguelike where players take on the role of ruthless samurai apes on a revenge spree against the mafia who exploited their sacred Shrine of Vermillion.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The Shrine now demands retribution\u2014delivered by katana through swift and unrelenting violence.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3499930/extras/Banner1_CoOp.png?t=1744703111\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3499930/extras/gif1.gif?t=1744703111\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Mix both <strong>online</strong> and <strong>local co-op</strong> with friends on the couch &amp; friends joining in from across the world, all in the same run.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Or, <strong>go at it alone</strong> and see if you can get vengeance by yourself!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3499930/extras/Banner2_FastStealth.png?t=1744703111\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3499930/extras/gif2.gif?t=1744703111\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Combine swift dashes, bullet deflection, brutal takedowns, and charged attacks to dispatch enemies with samurai-like precision. Unleash devastating finishers and heal by absorbing the blood of your foes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Carve your path through procedurally crafted levels filled with challenges, secrets, and blood filled action.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3499930/extras/Banner3_PowerfulGunplay.png?t=1744703111\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3499930/extras/gif3.gif?t=1744703111\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Defeat enemies, seize their weapons, and turn their firepower against them\u2014until ammo runs dry. Then throw the gun back in their face and attack with a powered up katana attack to <strong>split them in half</strong>!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Blood will spray, limbs will fly and enemies will crawl away screaming for mercy, but no mercy will be given...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3499930/extras/Banner4_UnlockNewKatana.png?t=1744703111\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3499930/extras/gif4.gif?t=1744703111\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Explore a visually striking world where industrial-era machinery blends with blood-powered technology, to find ancient chests containing shards for powerful katanas and new gear.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Each katana has its <strong>unique perk</strong> empowering different playstyles.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3499930/extras/Banner5_UnlockNewKatana.png?t=1744703111\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3499930/extras/gif5.gif?t=1744703111\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Face a variety of increasingly challenging bosses that evolve in several stages while fighting them. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Defeat these formidable foes, grab their head and sacrifice it to the Shrine of Vermillion to bring back balance to the world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3499930/extras/Banner6_Replayability.png?t=1744703111\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3499930/extras/gif6.gif?t=1744703111\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Unlock World Mutations that drastically change the rules of gameplay and reward you with new Katanas by completing them.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Cursed Blood has a challenge for everyone and something to bite your teeth into for hours and hours.</p>","developers":["David Marquardt Studios"],"fullgame":{"appid":"3382290","name":"Cursed Blood"},"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3499930/d4893cd65772d15e87dfc12e9d85407d75355d0c/header.jpg?t=1744703111","is_free":true,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":257096463,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257096463/movie480.mp4?t=1744703108","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257096463/movie_max.mp4?t=1744703108"},"name":"Gameplay Trailer","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257096463/e7ed7f3f7aafa73e1bc647aa0f1355f9aba9effa/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1744703108","webm":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257096463/movie480_vp9.webm?t=1744703108","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257096463/movie_max_vp9.webm?t=1744703108"}}],"name":"Cursed Blood Demo","package_groups":[],"pc_requirements":[],"platforms":{"linux":false,"mac":false,"windows":true},"publishers":["David Marquardt Studios"],"ratings":{"dejus":{"banned":"0","descriptors":"Viol\u00eancia Extrema\nTemas sens\u00edveis\nLinguagem impr\u00f3pria","rating":"18","rating_generated":"1","required_age":"18","use_age_gate":"0"},"steam_germany":{"banned":"0","descriptors":"Drastische Gewalt\nDrogen\nDerbe Sprache","rating":"18","rating_generated":"1","required_age":"18","use_age_gate":"0"}},"release_date":{"coming_soon":true,"date":"23 Apr, 2025"},"required_age":0,"screenshots":[{"id":0,"path_full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3499930/ss_6c947ddf8d63d3990db1f5c8d54918540fa80a3b.1920x1080.jpg?t=1744703111","path_thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3499930/ss_6c947ddf8d63d3990db1f5c8d54918540fa80a3b.600x338.jpg?t=1744703111"},{"id":1,"path_full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3499930/ss_aff76d1f1213e6015bebf1c8802079e360430f7a.1